    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "A well-proportioned two-storey mid-terrace residence, ideally situated within the established and popular Woodbury development in Gorey. No. 39 offers bright and spacious accommodation arranged over two floors, together with a private rear garden and designated parking to the front. The property represents an excellent opportunity for first-time buyers, those seeking a comfortable home in a convenient town location, or purchasers looking to downsize.\r\n\r\nOn entering, a welcoming tiled entrance hall leads to a generous living room, featuring an attractive bay window which floods the room with natural light, together with an open fireplace creating a warm and inviting focal point. To the rear, the modern fitted kitchen provides a practical and contemporary space, complemented by a separate utility room and sliding patio door opening directly onto the private rear garden. Upstairs, there are two spacious double bedrooms. The principal bedroom benefits from a private ensuite, while a modern family bathroom completes the accommodation.\r\n\r\nExternally, the property is approached by a front lawn with designated parking. To the rear is a particularly appealing, fully enclosed garden, incorporating a generous, paved patio and lawn area. The walled and fenced boundaries provide an excellent degree of privacy, while the garden offers an ideal setting for outdoor dining, entertaining or relaxing.\r\n\r\nWoodbury enjoys a convenient and established location within easy walking distance of Gorey town centre. A wide range of shops, cafés, restaurants and essential services are readily accessible, while a selection of local schools, public transport links and sporting and recreational facilities are also close by. For commuters, the property benefits from excellent road connectivity, with convenient access to the N11/M11 motorway network, providing ease of access to Dublin, Wexford and surrounding areas."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall\r\nTiled throughout\r\nLiving Room\r\nOpen fireplace, new carpet installed, bay window \r\nKitchen\r\nModern fitted kitchen, ample storage, sliding patio door to the garden\r\nUtility\r\nVinyl Floor covering, plumbed for washing machine\r\nMain Bedroom \r\nSizable double bedroom, oak laminate floor, fitted wardrobes \r\nEnsuite\r\nTiled shower cubicle with electric Triton T90 shower, WC & WHB\r\nBedroom 2 \r\nLarge double bedroom, oak laminate floor, fitted wardrobes \r\nFamily Bathroom\r\nBath, WHB, WC"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Well-maintained mid-terrace, two-storey residence \r\nBright, well-proportioned accommodation\r\nModern fitted kitchen with direct access to rear garden\r\nTwo spacious double bedrooms, main bedroom featuring a private ensuite\r\nFresh, modern family bathroom on the first floor\r\nOil Fired Central Heating\r\nFront lawn and designated parking space\r\nFully enclosed rear garden with lawn and patio area\r\nPrime location within walking distance of Gorey town centre\r\nExcellent access to the N11 and M11"
      },
